# Binary files on the VM (relative to /opt/northstar/apps/minecraft/data) that are
# too large or non-redistributable to commit. deploy-infra.sh warns if the live
# files drift from this list. After installing/updating a jar, refresh it with:
#   ssh northstar 'cd /opt/northstar/apps/minecraft/data && sha256sum plugins/*.jar world/datapacks/*.zip'
#
# Sources (plugins are manual jars, not auto-downloaded, because Paper releases
# are often newer than several plugins' published builds):
#   ArmorStandEditor 26.1.2-51 (Modrinth, no 26.2 build yet; runs fine on 26.2)
#   EtherealPortals 1.2.0-MC26.2 (Modrinth) | ChestSorter 2.1.0-MC26.2 (Modrinth, replaced QuickSortX)
#   Movecraft dev-build (GitHub Actions artifact, commit b49f891c) - currently .disabled
